ax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\theta\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nthere are values of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha,\\gamma,\\sigma_Z^2,\\sigma_X^2,\\sigma_Y^2)\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FC TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6FE TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.3em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.3em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msubsup space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.3em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>,\nwith <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_Z^2>0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.3em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X^2>0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.3em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>X</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_Y^2\\ge0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.3em; margin-left: 0;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2265\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, for which <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"(X,Y)\\sim\\mathrm{N}_2(\\mathbf{0},\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44C TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c223C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D6BA TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. Hence\nthe observational distribution constrains the causal effect not at all:\n<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"exr-cau-observational-equivalence\">@exr-cau-observational-equivalence</span>\nexhibits two values of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\theta\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\ncompatible with one distribution, and in fact no value is ever\nexcluded.</p>","file":"ch25-causal-interpretation/01-prediction-intervention.html"}